WEBVTT

00:15:00.454 --> 00:15:08.204
but they are not capable of sitting down
in cold blood and planning to torture

00:15:08.996 --> 00:15:15.704
an individual who's not even present. Wow,
that's what I consider evil.

00:15:17.537 --> 00:15:18.954
That's such a powerful statement.

00:15:19.829 --> 00:15:22.662
This touches on a theme that
you mentioned earlier,

00:15:22.662 --> 00:15:24.537
and it's another thread
that I wanted to pull,

00:15:24.537 --> 00:15:28.746
which is about this distinction between
dominance and respect or prestige.

00:15:29.496 --> 00:15:34.204
So you mention that a lot of chimps
are able to gain alpha status